  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "她被关了二十四年，法院终于改判：无罪。",
      "sha256": "4970f9e3187e119644d1b1da49c5c8c2e545e86622d51e1db705182db3b09fbf",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.336,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.664
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "可更离谱的是，检方咬定：她，就是凶手。",
      "sha256": "8a578a96778f9e10094b215d16ea0a77560b0d8c3fcc6b55460a5efe03dfebbf",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.467,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.533
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "两千年三月七日凌晨，完岛公交站旁，五十二岁男子突然身亡。",
      "sha256": "8b334c3a7ea3d15567cd415fc249a78cb5a63f64c440bc9e36843e97227429a4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.4,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "验尸查出高浓度酒精与安眠药成分，警方立刻盯上了他的大女儿。",
      "sha256": "4fca1f2075782dea7ea8b25d5c98e6418ac2be6baf50168a1b7185d62a83b203",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.087,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.913
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "她叫金信惠，那年才二十三岁，早早辍学打工养家。",
      "sha256": "3bb8d6ba9e3c94a92cf126edfc71f2a00bef7f82af4bdb35cbaf08444062e744",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.008,
      "atempo": 1.0014,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "谁料夜班刚回到家，等她的却是父亲的死讯。",
      "sha256": "4c397640c33386be79d165a4d52bd6e21010136e47efc212f0ba41e45b397e43",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.728,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.272
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "警方称她有预谋：被指控把安眠药掺进洋酒，哄骗父亲喝下。",
      "sha256": "1de644b8237782562b781ee5d3f5e78219b135033c21a9a937795d918b927a9b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.4,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.6
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "警方当年称：为八份保险，或因遭侵害报复，但再审认定证据不足。",
      "sha256": "f21b0881239700f47766390f4000857a71591f394a1010fd7a014ed9277bb60c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.837,
      "atempo": 1.1195,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "更要命的是，彻夜审讯之后，她面对警方竟松了口。",
      "sha256": "98ec5cb715426dbaa0c5a912994ec754b79376f6a4e20db57d27d9232bd5a14e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.068,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.932
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "在警方拿出的笔录上，她亲口认了罪。",
      "sha256": "c53ab3933d09bca3258d44af1d104279fca8c0fd823e062ab7a14fe6ff732fc4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.056,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.944
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "案子看似铁证如山，可一上法庭，她却当场翻供：我没有杀人！",
      "sha256": "48202ff6f3b02a147f594919bb4a002997bada2234be4c3b27c4ec75659a412d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.478,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.522
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "她称认罪，全因姑父私下说：弟弟像是凶手，你不认他就完了。",
      "sha256": "5528b735b9f23e2ab7a0b85c0a9caf74de09148e8feb87b97d9fe21c5ef244db",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.825,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.175
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "看着年少的弟弟，她称自己当时只想替他顶罪。",
      "sha256": "1a792c129b6ccfacb29867a0961d2218831e011c547c63cd8c9b211f34577585",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.389,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.611
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "于是她推开审讯室的门，亲手揽下罪名。",
      "sha256": "99800d02633121c3f4c371407e7c8b026e10b8b21bb26b2db0ba9020e3b350e3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.84,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.16
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "法院没有采信，二零零零年八月，她被判无期徒刑。",
      "sha256": "2697bfbbfd602cd214ee69ee4a4d4ad6f359f254a85c48269971c3e1b5e0b997",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.12,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "高墙之内十几年，她就这么从青年熬到了中年。",
      "sha256": "311ac8c4ce4c377821c075eb654cd291a577cf2e4b4baa3eeb3d27d864f38aa2",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.676,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.324
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "十几年她不停写信喊冤，可寄出的信总石沉大海。",
      "sha256": "591f62ff2d5e61da93a6517624d74c77808748826b9f828b78747ec1da5c65cb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.749
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "直到二零一四年，律师朴俊英走进了监狱。",
      "sha256": "39b7bd0cabe881d21ca38d7515e1a8ec57c7e238fce8f87688e3fe89546685bc",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.18,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.82
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "接下来才是真正的反转：旧卷宗里，漏洞百出！",
      "sha256": "c09913d62dd53dafbfe3da8e967159b0dd2b49ea19191ef0afe41a504c5636bf",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.12,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "警察当年没有搜查令就闯进她家，收走那本关键笔记。",
      "sha256": "c145dfd5d2e208db32f224ce3117ebd4880fa28952432ffdbac8fdd0ef99c31e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.754,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.246
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "她还称在审讯室遭拍桌施压，被迫按下了指印。",
      "sha256": "55ddec388f3ac60ee353130379cc30d12e9c8f4971d4fca240c726a844d3c032",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.071,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "至于八份保险，有的早已解约，动机还成立吗？",
      "sha256": "14d0fcca72301e5a139f665f377feb4d175607b683d3f5a57e4abc2079a41e3a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.068,
      "atempo": 1.0136,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "二零一五年，法院终于决定再审，亲友们终于等来转机。",
      "sha256": "f36a2869936bdfecdffead23d2b7fddb4c7bf422df4cdcc2b67d4e0dca73a0b3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.93,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.07
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "这一审，就是整整九年，卷宗越叠越高，庭审一次又一次。",
      "sha256": "31758f204b85c149db004df931e92d7914509062959f4fcbd30b91a5a6ea5a29",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.557,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.443
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "二零二五年一月六日，法院当庭宣判：无罪！",
      "sha256": "dd54513e3ec24d4710a8b053c8927c1f67a3a98c37aaccda15dfd340301b2f0b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.467,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.533
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "被关二十四年十个月后，四十七岁的她终于走出铁门。",
      "sha256": "07cb8790d5008c1984091d4de6c599353196534683c9cad33285ac088f9fc455",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.747,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.253
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "可故事还没结束，检方随即上诉，他们也有另一套说辞。",
      "sha256": "4938257d3edc512757abcc3b7a459588426e49421dca395c063cdd013f664cc9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.956,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.044
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "检方称她早向亲戚坦白且鉴定吻合，二审至今还在进行。",
      "sha256": "6315745ad156c24347027869c55b5230f88ddd98f2b174aa3742fcdd6e6e5a5f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.635,
      "atempo": 1.1059,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "她说，自己的整个青春，都是在监狱高墙里度过的。",
      "sha256": "5da0e3741621c5c4a67fb056f548982dcaacc283eedbe31d57bd52a411e10c61",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.12,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "现在，如果你是法官，你到底信哪个版本？",
      "sha256": "f51fa81524f0bcb273180dd889f90153d1a4d682d75979aa13c1fd704392b576",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声电影解说",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.709,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.291
    }
  ]
}
